    "detailed_description": "Crash'em Derby is a crowd-play game designed around the classic destruction derby experience. <br>Twitch streamers share the gameplay with their followers, interacting through chat and video. This is a gaming collision of muscle car culture and social video streaming at its finest, with a growing collection of playable cars and arenas.<br><br>Crash'em Derby features car customization tools for viewers, a copyright-free music player courtesy of Alibi Music, a variety of arenas, and is free to play!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interactive social gameplay using Twitch <br><br></li><li>Allows viewers to compete against one another<br><br></li><li>Works with up to 200 players<br><br></li><li>A variety of unique maps<br><br></li><li>Vehicle customization via the Binx community site<br><br></li><li>Global leaderboard<br><br></li><li>CARNAGE!</li></ul>",
